# Git history

- Branch as `feature/<short-name>` (example: `feature/pio-hsync`). Never `cursor/<name>` or other tool/vendor prefixes.
- Commits use the repo owner's GitHub identity. Do not add Cursor (or any agent) as collaborator, committer, co-author, or `Co-authored-by` trailer.
- Do not invite Cursor to the GitHub repo.
